ber\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0093-4ac4e36e016b:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 107, \"text\": \"households were made up of individuals and 13.6% had someone living alone who was 65 years of age or older.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0093-4ac4e36e016b:d00\", \"start\": 108, \"end\": 181, \"text\": \"The average household size was 2.23 and the average family size was 2.83.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0093-4ac4e36e016b:d00\", \"start\": 182, \"end\": 224, \"text\": \"The median age in the town was 42.7 years.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0093-4ac4e36e016b:d00\", \"start\": 225, \"end\": 404, \"text\": \"Of residents 19.9% were under the age of 18; 12.3% were between the ages of 18 and 24; 20.7% were from 25 to 44; 29.5% were from 45 to 64; and 17.6% were 65 years of age or older.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0093-4ac4e36e016b:d00\", \"start\": 405, \"end\": 467, \"text\": \"The gender makeup of the town was 48.0% male and 52.0% female.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0093-4ac4e36e016b:d00\", \"start\": 468, \"end\": 499, \"text\": \"As of the census of 2000, there\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0093-4ac4e36e016b:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 207, \"text\": \"18 living with them , 49.5 % were married couples living together , 8.0 % had a female householder with no husband present , 3.4 % had a male householder with no wife present , and 39.2 % were non-families .\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0093-4ac4e36e016b:d01\", \"start\": 208, \"end\": 333, \"text\": \"31.4 % of all households were made up of individuals , and 13.6 % had someone living alone who was 65 years of age or older .\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0093-4ac4e36e016b:d01\", \"start\": 334, \"end\": 408, \"text\": \"The average household size was 2.23 and the average family size was 2.83 .\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0093-4ac4e36e016b:d01\", \"start\": 409, \"end\": 452, \"text\": \"The median age in the town was 42.7 years .\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0093-4ac4e36e016b:d01\", \"start\": 453, \"end\": 491, \"text\": \"Of residents 19.9 % were under the age\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0093-4ac4e36e016b:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 26, \"text\": \"gender assigned at birth .\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0093-4ac4e36e016b:d02\", \"start\": 27, \"end\": 156, \"text\": \"This information is important for healthcare planning , policy making , social research , and economic planning and development .\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0093-4ac4e36e016b:d02\", \"start\": 157, \"end\": 261, \"text\": \"2,302 49.77 % Median Age : The Median Age of all persons from the 2020 Census for this geographic area .\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0093-4ac4e36e016b:d02\", \"start\": 262, \"end\": 310, \"text\": \"Median age is the middle age of the population .\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0093-4ac4e36e016b:d02\", \"start\": 311, \"end\": 381, \"text\": \"Half the people are older than the average age and half area younger .\"}, \"D3S6\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0093-4ac4e36e016b:d02\", \"start\": 382, \"end\": 462, \"text\": \"Median Age can relate how young or old a geographic area is compared to others .\"}, \"D3S7\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0093-4ac4e36e016b:d02\", \"start\": 463, \"end\": 528, \"text\": \"46.2 years Male Median Age : The Median Age of all Males from the\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0093-4ac4e36e016b:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0093-4ac4e36e016b:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"median age\", \"scope\": \"Fort Kent\", \"claim\": \"The median age in th